panero (0.1.0~preview.6-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Sixth preview (git tag v0.1.0-preview.6).
  * Cloud sign-in no longer waits forever when rclone cannot finish the setup
    after the browser step (e.g. OneDrive cannot list the account's drives):
    Panero shows rclone's error and a hint, with a time limit.
  * OneDrive asks only for the access shown in the dialog (preview 5 asked
    for all files incl. shared ones); the main drive of the account is used.
  * Google Drive and OneDrive icons in Add Cloud and in the sidebar.

